</style>



<b>Not planning to attend the University of St. Thomas?</b>

<br>

Please complete the form to let us know. You''ll need your St. Thomas ID (see above) and the email address you used to apply.

<br>

<br>

<div class="USTEventButton">

    <center><a href="https://stthomas.az1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_dhawoOdY0OClnFz" method="get" target="_blank">

