INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-39','True','False','False','','Started App;Submitted App','','','2022-09-27T18:27:51.000+0000','Master''s','','1.0','True','True','Started App','','','AS_EN_MA|ENGL','','','','','<center><b><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696>Personal Statement</b></Font><Font color=Red>*</Font></center>

<br>

<br>

Submit a personal statement of no more than 500 words indicating your aspirations for pursuing graduate study in English, your academic plans, and your goals for a professional career in English.

<br>

<br>

File must be a MS Word (.doc or .docx), Rich Text Format (.rtf), Text (.txt) or PDF (.pdf) document, and not exceed 4 MB. Please be advised, PDF file format uploads are strongly recommended as other file formats may be altered during the upload process.','','False','False','Personal Statement','2025-04-11T02:55:18.000+0000','','Personal Statement - EN MA ENG(GCAS)','','','','012DS00000AdtxiYAB','','','','','','','','Started App','ReqItemUuid-6a645124-11a6-4f93-a811-ab88391c9b38','','','English','True','','','Requirement__c-269');
INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-40','True','False','False','','Started App;Submitted App','','','2022-09-27T18:27:51.000+0000','Certificate','','2.0','True','True','Started App','','','','','','','','<b>Writing Sample</b><Font color=Red>*</Font>

<br>

<br>

Please submit an academic writing sample of between 10-12 pages demonstrating skills in critical thinking, logical development, and writing style.

<br>

<br>

File must be a MS Word (.doc or .docx), Rich Text Format (.rtf), Text (.txt) or PDF (.pdf) document, and not exceed 4 MB. Please be advised, PDF file format uploads are strongly recommended as other file formats may be altered during the upload process.','','False','False','Writing Sample','2025-04-11T02:55:18.000+0000','','Writing Sample - CS Certificate (GCAS)','','','','012DS00000AdtxiYAB','','','','','','','','Started App','ReqItemUuid-6ad1b302-4db5-4ae0-b8c3-d16d26cf7404','','','Catholic Studies','True','','','Requirement__c-269');
INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-41','True','False','False','','Started App;Submitted App','','','2022-09-27T18:27:51.000+0000','Master''s','','4.0','True','True','Started App','','','','','','','','<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Joint Certificate in Museum Studies and MA Program in Art History</b></Font></center>

<br>

<br>

The University of St. Thomas offers the option of combining the MA Program in Art History with the Certificate in Museum Studies (more info can be found at stthomas.edu/museumstudies). <b>If you are interested in including the Certificate in Museum Studies, please submit a personal statement of no more than 500 words describing why museum studies is important to your research and career goals, any experience that you have had in museums, non-profit, library science, or collections work, and what you hope to gain by earning the Certificate.</b>

<br>

<br>

<i>File must be a MS Word (.doc or .docx), Rich Text Format (.rtf), Text (.txt) or PDF (.pdf) document, and not exceed 4 MB. Please be advised, PDF file format uploads are strongly recommended as other file formats may be altered during the upload process.</i>','','False','False','','2025-04-11T02:55:18.000+0000','','Joint AH and MS (GCAS)','','','','012DS00000AdtxiYAB','','','','','','','','','ReqItemUuid-7e6bb93a-dc90-47a1-a164-03e6dc651ac5','','','Art History / Museum Studies','True','','','Requirement__c-269');
INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-42','True','False','False','','Started App;Submitted App','','','2022-09-27T18:27:51.000+0000','Master''s','','1.0','True','True','Started App','','','','','','','','<center><b><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696>Personal Statement</b></Font><Font color=Red>*</Font></center>

<br>

<br>

<b>Submit a personal statement of 700 words or less indicating your reasons for pursuing graduate work in Catholic Studies, as well as your academic plans and any relevant future goals.</b>

<br>

<br>

