INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-46','True','False','False','','Started App;Submitted App','','','2022-09-27T18:27:51.000+0000','Certificate','','2.0','True','True','Started App','','','','','','','','<center><b><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696>Writing Sample</b></Font><Font color=Red>*</Font></center>

<br>

<br>

Please provide a writing sample, in Spanish, of literary, cultural, or linguistic analysis; or a research paper relevant to Spanish teaching pedagogy or Spanish for the professions. This 7-15 page, double-spaced paper (one-inch margins) should be a close, analytical reading of a text, a cultural phenomenon or linguistic phenomenon, or a research paper on pedagogy or Spanish for the professions rather than a broad overview of a topic. You may consider revising a previous paper to reflect your current writing and analytical abilities. Please include any research references in a bibliography.

<br>

<br>

