INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-160','True','False','False','','','','','2022-09-30T14:58:51.000+0000','Master''s','','','True','False','','','','','','','','0014P000042RTrW','Thanks for answering the questions above. Please attach a separate letter providing feedback regarding applicant''s academic, professional, and personal characteristics including:



* Circumstances in which you are familiar with the applicant’s work, and the nature of the work that they performed

* Applicant’s ability and demonstration for self-reflection, engagement, empathy, and respect for others

* Their engagement as a learner and preparation for graduate education (if applicable)

* And personal, professional, or educational related experiences that will prepare the applicant for advanced social work practice; demonstrated experiences and examples are encouraged as it will help in determining the applicant’s fit with our program.



