INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-175','True','False','False','','Started App','','','2022-09-27T18:27:52.000+0000','Master''s','','1.0','True','True','Started App','','','PS_GR_MA|CPSY','','','','','<center><b><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696>Statement of Purpose</b></Font><Font color=Red>*</Font></center>

<br>

<br>

Submit a concise, 3-page, double-spaced essay addressing your fit with the field of counseling psychology and more specifically the Graduate School of Professional Psychology (GSPP). Please describe your reasons for seeking a Master’s degree and what goals you hope to reach through the acquisition of the degree. Additionally, the field of counseling places high value on personal self-knowledge and self-awareness. Please write about your awareness of your place in a diverse society and how you have come to know this. What do you bring to the work of a counselor?

<br>

<br>

