INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-340','True','False','False','','','','','2022-09-30T19:29:41.000+0000','','','2.0','True','False','','','','BU_EX_MBA|EXMB','','','','','<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Dean''s Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



Merit-based scholarships are available to select candidates with strong applications. All applicants are automatically considered for the Dean’s Scholarship. No separate essay is required.



<br>



<br> 

<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>$10,000 Guaranteed Scholarship</b></Font></center>

<br>

Students who submit their application by June 30 and are admitted to the Executive MBA program will receive an automatic $10,000 scholarship towards the cost of the program.



<br>

<br>

<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Non-profit Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



All applicants with a demonstrated commitment to the non-profit sector are automatically considered for the Non-profit Scholarship. To be eligible, you must have two or more years full-time work experience at an established non-profit organization and show evidence of a strong dedication to serving the community. No separate essay is required.



<br>

<br>



<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Alumni Referral Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



If you were referred to the Executive MBA program by one of our current Executive MBA students or alumni, you are eligible for our Alumni Referral Scholarship award. How to qualify:

<br>

The Executive MBA student or alumni that refers you <b>must fill out this <a href="https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=ef-BoIwx7EWV8zjrwoAUch7xqw3EL3dKqXuNJi9hXhZUOFlUTEcxNldYU0YwQktFTEVIWTkxMTQ1Ty4u&wdLOR=c351C8892-E285-C443-BE8F-2B9919A5DD67" method="get" target="_blank">Form</a>.</b>

<br>If you are accepted to the program after being referred, you will receive a $1,000 scholarship towards your first semester in the program.

<br>The Executive MBA alumni or student who referred you will receive a St. Thomas Executive MBA pullover.



<br>

<br>



<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Diversity and Inclusion Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



Scholarships are available to applicants who demonstrate a history of academic and professional success, leadership, service, and engagement in cultural or cross-cultural initiatives in previous academic, professional, or volunteer settings. Strong candidates will be domestic candidates with two or more years of full-time work experience after college graduation, have a strong undergraduate academic record, and show evidence of committed involvement in activities, programs, or initiatives that foster inclusion, cross-cultural awareness, or a commitment to diversity in its many forms. <b>To be considered, review the scholarship requirements on our website and submit a statement</b> (no more than 300 words) describing the most relevant experiences that qualify you for this award.','','False','False','Scholarships','2025-04-11T02:55:18.000+0000','','All Scholarships - MBA EXEC (GOCB)','','','','012DS00000AdtxiYAB','','','','','','','','','ReqItemUuid-850ef1c7-e634-4317-89c5-103f333f5cf3','','','','True','','','Requirement__c-13');
INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-341','True','False','False','','','','','2022-09-30T19:41:01.000+0000','','','2.0','True','False','','','','BU_HC_MBA|HCMB','','','','','<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Dean''s Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



Merit-based scholarships are available to select candidates with strong applications. All applicants are automatically considered for the Dean’s Scholarship. No separate essay is required.



<br>

<br> 

<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>$10,000 Guaranteed Scholarship</b></Font></center>

<br>

Students who submit their application by June 30 and are admitted to the HEALTH CARE MBA program will receive an automatic $10,000 scholarship towards the cost of the program.



<br>

<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Nursing Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



All applicants working in nursing will be automatically considered for the Nursing Scholarship. No separate essay is required.

<br>



<br>



<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Alumni Referral Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



If you were referred to the Health Care MBA program by one of our current Health Care MBA students or alumni, you are eligible for our Alumni Referral Scholarship award. How to qualify:

<br>

The Health Care MBA student or alumni that refers you <b>must fill out this <a href="https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=ef-BoIwx7EWV8zjrwoAUch7xqw3EL3dKqXuNJi9hXhZUOFlUTEcxNldYU0YwQktFTEVIWTkxMTQ1Ty4u&wdLOR=c351C8892-E285-C443-BE8F-2B9919A5DD67" method="get" target="_blank">Form.</a></b>

<br>If you are accepted to the program after being referred, you will receive a $1,000 scholarship towards your first semester in the program.

<br>The Health Care MBA alumni or student who referred you will receive a St. Thomas Health Care MBA pullover.



<br>

<br>

<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Diversity and Inclusion Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



Scholarships are available to applicants who demonstrate a history of academic and professional success, leadership, service, and engagement in cultural or cross-cultural initiatives in previous academic, professional, or volunteer settings. Strong candidates will be domestic candidates with two or more years of full-time work experience after college graduation, have a strong undergraduate academic record, and show evidence of committed involvement in activities, programs, or initiatives that foster inclusion, cross-cultural awareness, or a commitment to diversity in its many forms. <b>To be considered, review the scholarship requirements on our website and submit a statement </b>(no more than 300 words) describing the most relevant experiences that qualify you for this award.','','False','False','Scholarships','2025-04-11T02:55:18.000+0000','','All Scholarship - HEALTH CARE MBA(GOCB)','','','','012DS00000AdtxiYAB','','','','','','','','','ReqItemUuid-cd5feca6-f3b0-4b5a-9ef7-874f5fcff594','','','','True','','','Requirement__c-13');
INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-342','True','False','False','','','','','2022-09-27T18:27:51.000+0000','','','2.0','True','False','','','','BU_PT_MBA|PTMB','','','','','<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Dean''s Scholarship</b></Font></center>



