<br>

<br>

<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Tommie Alumni Scholarship</b></Font></center>



<br>



All St. Thomas undergraduate alumni are automatically awarded the Tommie Alumni Scholarship to cover tuition for one 3-credit course. No separate essay is required.

<br>

<br>



<center><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696><b>Diversity and Inclusion Scholarship</b></Font></center>



