INSERT INTO "Requirement_Item__c" VALUES('Requirement_Item__c-504','True','False','False','','Started App','','','2022-09-27T18:27:52.000+0000','Certificate','','1.0','True','True','Started App','','','','','','','','<center><b><Font size=4 Font color=#6d3696>Personal Statement</b></Font><Font color=Red>*</Font></center>

<br>

<br>

Please include a personal essay (1,000 words or less) responding to the following questions: 

<br>

(1) What is your philosophy of education? And 

<br>

(2) What is the rationale for your application, and what do you hope to gain from your participation in the Catholic School Leadership certificate program?  

